# Local scratch folder — temporary debug logs, scan outputs, throwaway
# scripts, debug images, and commit-message drafts moved here from root
# to keep the project root clean. Safe to delete in bulk at any time.
scratch/

# W22 manual-deletion folder — accumulated `??` working scratch
# (49 tracked `md/COMMIT_MSG_*.txt` files + 16 untracked scratch +
# 9 `md/jest_*.txt` + 1 `md/lint_*.txt` + 1 `scripts/_v21_p17_swap_mmkv.py`
# + the W1 P03 retired `md/_v21_p03_dead_code/` subdir) that the user
# wants to delete manually. The folder itself + everything inside is
# OUT of git (the 49 tracked files were `git rm`'d in the W22 move;
# the rest was untracked). Safe to delete in bulk at any time.
#
# The `delete_me/**` pattern (not just `delete_me/`) matches the
# directory's contents recursively — without it, git shows the
# directory itself in `git status` even though the contents are
# all ignored.
delete_me/
delete_me/**
